<p>In this page you can enter the details of any Kathakali being held in the coming days.... </p>
<form name="form1" action="enter1.asp" method="post">
  <p><strong>ENTER THE EVENT/PROGRAMME DETAILS </strong></p>
  <table bgcolor="#FF99FF">
  <tr><td><p>enter your name*:</td><td><input name="name" type="text" size="25" maxlength="30" /></td>
  </p></tr>
  <tr><td><p>katha(kathas)*: </td>
    <td><input name="kathas" type="text" size="100" maxlength="110" />
  </p></td></tr>
  <tr><td valign="middle">date*: (eg: 01-02-07)</td>
  <td valign="middle">date:
    <input name="dd" type="text" size="1" maxlength="2" />
month:
<input name="mm" type="text" size="1" maxlength="2" />
 year:
 <input name="yy" type="text" size="1" maxlength="2" />  
</td>
  </tr>
  <tr><td><p>venue and time*:</td><td>
    <input name="venue" type="text" size="75" maxlength="80" />
</p></td></tr>
 <tr><td>district: 
    </td><td><input name="district" type="text" size="25" maxlength="30" /></td></tr>
    <tr><td>state: 
    </td><td><input name="state" type="text" value="Kerala" size="25" maxlength="30" /></td></tr>
    <tr><td>country:
    </td><td><input name="country" type="text" value="India" size="25" maxlength="30" /></td></tr>
  
 <tr><td> <p>artists performing*:</p>
  </td>
 <td>Please use short forms such as "Kala" instead of "Kalamandalam" in order not to exceed total string limit (about 1200 characters)
    <textarea name="artists" cols="80" rows="5"></textarea>
  </td></tr>
  <tr><td><p>organised by,contact no of the organiser if any: 
    </td><td><input name="org" type="text" size="45" maxlength="50" />
  </p></td></tr>
  <tr><td><p>If you have finished entering the details you can submit</td><td> <input name="sub1" type="submit" value="submit"/>
  </p></td></tr></table>(all the fields with * are mandatory)
  <p>&nbsp; </p>

</form>
